[3.9, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.2, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[36mNOTE0002\u001b[m  \u001b[90mnote\u001b[m\r\n"]
[4.3, "o", "  \u001b[90mparent:\u001b[m ABC12345\r\n"]
[4.4, "o", "  \u001b[90mtitle:\u001b[m Reading summary \u2014 scaling claims\r\n"]
[4.5, "o", "  \u001b[90mtags:\u001b[m reading-group, llm\r\n\r\n"]
[4.8, "o", "Wei et al. argue emergent abilities appear discontinuously with scale.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "Two caveats worth chasing:\r\n\r\n"]
[5.2, "o", "- The discontinuity may be an artifact of the metric \u2014 exact-match\r\n"]
[5.3, "o", "  accuracy is thresholded. See Schaeffer et al. 2023.\r\n"]
[5.5, "o", "- Every emergence plot here is log-x; the jump is far less dramatic\r\n"]
[5.6, "o", "  on a linear axis.\r\n\r\n"]
[5.9, "o", "Follow-up for reading group: pull the BIG-bench task list and check\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "which tasks use non-thresholded metrics.\r\n"]
[7.0, "o", "$ "]
